%I A401352 #10 Oct 24 2026 09:42:04
%S A401352 2,67,7416,293590,8859959
%N A401352 Number of free polycubes with 3n cells that can be trisected into three congruent polycubes.
%C A401352 Each piece is necessarily a polycube of size n. Here congruent means equal up to rotation, reflection and translation, so the various pieces may be mirror images of each other.
%H A401352 John Mason, <a href="https://github.com/jmasonmilan/PolyUtil">Java programs to generate the sequence</a>
%Y A401352 Cf. A038119, A400883, A401351.
%K A401352 nonn,more,new
%O A401352 1,1
%A A401352 _John Mason_, Oct 23 2026
